sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as 业务代码
    participant Loader as ServiceLoader
    participant Registry as 生成的 ServiceRegistry
    participant Entry as ServiceSupplier 注册项
    participant Provider as ServiceLazy / SingletonServiceSupplier
    participant Factory as ServiceFactory
    participant Impl as 服务实现类

    App->>Loader: load(ServiceType, alias)
    Loader->>Registry: get(ServiceType, alias)
    Note over Registry: 首次加载类时执行静态注册，顺序为 priority 再类名
    Registry->>Registry: 按类型取注册项并精确过滤非空 alias
    loop 每个匹配注册项
        Registry->>Entry: getSupplier()
        alt singleton=true
            Entry-->>Registry: 全局 SingletonServiceSupplier
        else singleton=false
            Entry-->>Registry: 原始 ServiceFactory
            Registry->>Provider: 新建 ServiceLazy(factory)
        end
    end
    Registry-->>Loader: 不可变的有序 ServiceFactory 列表
    Loader-->>App: Iterable<ServiceType>

    App->>Loader: iterator.next() / firstPriority
    Loader->>Provider: get()
    alt ServiceLazy 当前缓存为空
        Provider->>Factory: get()
        Factory->>Impl: 调用无参构造函数
        Impl-->>Provider: 实例
        Provider->>Provider: 双重检查并缓存
    else SingletonServiceSupplier 当前缓存为空
        Provider->>Impl: newInstance() 调用无参构造函数
        Impl-->>Provider: 实例
        Provider->>Provider: 双重检查并缓存
    else 已有缓存
        Provider->>Provider: 直接读取缓存
    end
    Provider-->>App: 服务实例
    Note over Loader,Provider: 非单例按每次 load 缓存；singleton=true 跨 load、跨接口共享
    Note over Loader,Registry: lastPriority 遍历整个 Iterable，会触发所有候选 get()
